# Policy & Security

## Policy engine boundary
- `policy_gate.check(stage_id, phase, payload)` is the SINGLE entry point.
  `phase` ∈ {`entry`, `exit`}.
- Internally composes: Presidio (PII) → OPA (Rego rules) → 
  Guardrails.ai (structural validation for LLM outputs).
- Returns `PolicyDecision(allowed: bool, violations: list, 
  requires_hitl: bool, redactions: dict)`.

## OPA rules
- Rego packages in `policies/*.rego`. One package per policy family.
- Every policy has a corresponding test in `policies/*_test.rego`.
- Loaded via OPA server (sidecar in docker-compose).

## PII
- Presidio config in `services/policy_engine/presidio_wrapper.py`.
- Redact by default; log the fact of redaction (never the content) 
  to the audit event.
- Financial-services PII entities: SSN, credit card, bank account, 
  routing number, IBAN — all enabled.

## Guardrails.ai
- Structured outputs for all LLM code-generation nodes. On validation 
  failure, force one retry with corrective feedback in the prompt. 
  After that, escalate to HITL.

## Audit for policy actions
- Every policy check emits `PolicyCheckEvent` with `decision`, 
  `violations` (redacted), `elapsed_ms`. Include Rego bundle version.